# Comptes MQTT de demonstration.
# Objectif: eviter qu'un client anonyme puisse publier de faux vitaux.

# Hardware accounts must be named exactly like inventory device IDs.
# Provision each password separately; this pattern grants only its own endpoint.
pattern write ehpad/hardware/v1/%u/telemetry
pattern write ehpad/hardware/v1/%u/status

user simulator
topic read ehpad/control/#
topic write ehpad/residents/#
topic write ehpad/zones/#
topic write ehpad/summary
topic write ehpad/+/+/vitals
topic write ehpad/+/+/motion
topic write ehpad/+/+/bp_temp
topic write ehpad/+/+/sos
topic write ehpad/+/ambient/env
topic write ehpad/+/door/ambient

user backend
topic read ehpad/#
topic write ehpad/control/#
topic write health/check

user dashboard
topic read ehpad/summary
topic read ehpad/alerts/#

user healthcheck
topic write health/check
